&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating complicated technical problems to both technical and business audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of thinking through and shipping quality user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for AI driven engineering practices and a continuous desire to optimize development lifecycles using modern automated tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
